      "updated": 1780174416267,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Screen purpose:\n    Home Screen, where a logged in user starts of\n    \n\nPrimary user action:\n    Operational as a main hub ->\n        -> Can start workout\n        -> Can go to last few workouts\n        -> Can go to Progress Menu View\n        -> Can go to Volume Menu View\nDisplayed data:\nInteractions:\nEmpty state:\nLoading state:\nMobile constraints:\nImplementation notes:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Screen purpose:\n    Home Screen, where a logged in user starts of\n    \n\nPrimary user action:\n    Operational as a main hub ->\n        -> Can start workout\n        -> Can go to last few workouts\n        -> Can go to Progress Menu View\n        -> Can go to Volume Menu View\nDisplayed data:\nInteractions:\nEmpty state:\nLoading state:\nMobile constraints:\nImplementation notes:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
